WEBVTT

NOTE
Canonical narration text; deterministic paragraph-window timing.
Text and terminology reviewed against the chapter packet on 2026-07-29.
Publication still requires final listening review against the authorized narration master.

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.447
A living technical book is not a document that changes often.

2
00:00:05.447 --> 00:00:10.694
It is a system that can change without losing its source

3
00:00:10.694 --> 00:00:15.941
identity, claim history, failed tests, or public truth. New papers arrive,

4
00:00:15.941 --> 00:00:20.711
chapters split, proof targets move, support can strengthen or weaken,

5
00:00:20.711 --> 00:00:25.005
and derivatives drift. A static PDF freezes one moment.

6
00:00:25.005 --> 00:00:30.252
A loose wiki changes without enough discipline. A code repository can

7
00:00:30.252 --> 00:00:35.499
validate shape without explaining the thesis. The ASI Stack therefore treats

8
00:00:35.499 --> 00:00:40.746
each substantive change as an Evidence-Preserving Publication Transaction over a governed

9
00:00:40.746 --> 00:00:41.700
artifact graph.

10
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:46.456
The transaction first freezes the objective, canonical commit,

11
00:00:46.456 --> 00:00:52.309
affected chapters and claims, audience, authority, rights, release target, environment, time,

12
00:00:52.309 --> 00:00:58.162
and explicit non-claims. Stable identities bind sources, passages, claims, proof targets,

13
00:00:58.162 --> 00:01:02.950
tests, figures, derivatives, releases, residuals, corrections, and successor work.

14
00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:08.271
Intake keeps source report, author intent, synthesis, experiment, formal proof,

15
00:01:08.271 --> 00:01:12.527
editorial judgment, and open question in separate lanes.

16
00:01:12.527 --> 00:01:18.379
A source count does not become evidence. A theorem build does

17
00:01:18.379 --> 00:01:23.700
not become enforcement. A polished paragraph does not become support.

18
00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:30.044
Each material claim is then atomized enough to name its scope,

19
00:01:30.044 --> 00:01:35.888
falsifier, evidence lanes, source mappings, contrary evidence, disposition, promotion ceiling, residual,

20
00:01:35.888 --> 00:01:41.731
and consumers. A typed change packet records what will move and

21
00:01:41.731 --> 00:01:47.575
why. Canonical records regenerate the outline, proof manifest, appendices, status surfaces,

22
00:01:47.575 --> 00:01:53.419
and reader projections. Validation is surface-specific: schema, semantics, sources, proofs, executables,

23
00:01:53.419 --> 00:01:58.200
negative controls, rights, accessibility, render, browser, release, reproducibility, deployment,

24
00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:04.044
and public observation remain different gates. Green is meaningful only for

25
00:02:04.044 --> 00:02:06.700
the contract that produced it.

26
00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:12.700
Derivatives are projections, not rival books. The AI and research view,

27
00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:18.200
Human view, reader manuscript, HTML, DOCX, EPUB, PDF, article, header image,

28
00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:23.700
audio, and chapter videos all bind the exact source commit, audience,

29
00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:29.200
transform policy, review state, approval, evidence effect, residuals, and non-claims. Generation,

30
00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:34.700
inspection, accessibility review, editorial approval, release approval, deployment, public observation, archive,

31
00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:40.200
and external publication are distinct states. A smooth synopsis may compress

32
00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:44.200
navigation, but it cannot absorb specialist claim ownership.

33
00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:49.700
A rendered video may explain a chapter, but cannot promote it.

34
00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:54.155
Now consider a correction. A source passage is withdrawn,

35
00:02:54.155 --> 00:02:58.988
so its mapping changes. The dependency graph identifies the affected claim,

36
00:02:58.988 --> 00:03:03.382
chapter prose, proof commentary, appendix rows, synopsis, transcript, video packet,

37
00:03:03.382 --> 00:03:08.215
and public page. The claim may be downgraded while the old

38
00:03:08.215 --> 00:03:13.048
release remains immutable and visibly historical. The current derivative becomes stale

39
00:03:13.048 --> 00:03:17.882
rather than silently current. Validators can catch missing regeneration and identity

40
00:03:17.882 --> 00:03:22.715
drift, but a human or separately authorized editorial process still owns

41
00:03:22.715 --> 00:03:27.548
interpretation, quality, rights, accessibility approval, and release. The correction closes only

42
00:03:27.548 --> 00:03:31.064
when every reachable consumer is updated, withdrawn, superseded,

43
00:03:31.064 --> 00:03:33.700
or held as an owned residual.

44
00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:38.985
The repository demonstrates portions of this method: generated scaffolds, machine-readable manifests,

45
00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:43.770
source and claim ledgers, schemas, finite Lean models, executable negative controls,

46
00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:47.685
changelog lineage, commit-bound builds, deployed-page crawls, and derivative custody.

47
00:03:47.685 --> 00:03:52.470
The strongest integrated bundle contains three versioned lifecycle slices, twelve cases,

48
00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:57.255
all ten modeled lifecycle states, six observed effects, three exact rollbacks,

49
00:03:57.255 --> 00:04:01.170
a partial-effect residual and quarantine, an eleven-surface sealed epoch,

50
00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:05.955
twenty boundary injections, and eleven rejecting mutations. That is substantial local

51
00:04:05.955 --> 00:04:10.740
publication discipline. It is not proof that every source interpretation is

52
00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:14.655
correct, every chapter is true, every format is accessible,

53
00:04:14.655 --> 00:04:17.700
or the method transfers to another project.

54
00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:21.423
The core remains Design rationale at argument support.

55
00:04:21.423 --> 00:04:25.452
Its maximum inference is bounded local replay only: no deployment,

56
00:04:25.452 --> 00:04:29.884
whole-book proof, external effect authority, transfer, publication, or release claim follows

57
00:04:29.884 --> 00:04:34.317
from the chapter. The book is part of its own argument,

58
00:04:34.317 --> 00:04:38.749
but self-application is not self-validation. The operational test is whether a

59
00:04:38.749 --> 00:04:43.181
future agent can discover what is canonical, what changed, what passed,

60
00:04:43.181 --> 00:04:46.404
what failed, what is public, what remains blocked,

61
00:04:46.404 --> 00:04:50.836
and which single roadmap has authority—without private memory. The next chapter,

62
00:04:50.836 --> 00:04:55.268
Open Research Agenda and Bibliography Plan, turns those unresolved obligations into

63
00:04:55.268 --> 00:04:59.700
a durable backlog for reading, building, testing, proving, reproducing, or rejecting.
